        <externalId>false</externalId>
        <inlineHelpText>The most recently updated PeopleSoft Major Interest, or if a PSMajor Interest does not exist, the most recently updated Academic, College, or Degree Search Interest.</inlineHelpText>
        <label>Primary Interest</label>
